 to talk to girls because of  something that happened years ago a girl  who he thought was his girlfriend  accused him of harassment for touching  her hand on reaching home z-way throws  random objects to the ground and creates  several girls to test if they are  compatible however the cactus plant  hurts him the coffee bean is too  energetic and the russian doll creates  more girls than he wants in the end he  decides to turn his phone into his  girlfriend since the phone knows  everything about z-way he believes his  next girlfriend will be the one it  transforms into a sophisticated woman  who can read z-way's mind without him  saying anything right after coming to  life she orders him food from his  favorite place and sets the table just  how he likes it she can help him with  anything in life because she is also the  smartest object in the room that  afternoon they go to a restaurant to  have lunch while they are at it zeeway's  former girlfriend who broke his heart  also arrives and sits at another table  she brags about her rich boyfriend to  z-way which the phone doesn't like so  she hacks into the girl's phone and  texts all of her current boyfriends they  arrive at the restaurant in no time and  her secret is revealed in front of  everyone the gesture makes z-wave fall  in love with the phone when they return  home she makes him sit by her side and  plants a kiss on his lips a while later  he falls asleep and it is revealed that  the phone is an evil object she has come  to life to make z-wave's life a living  hell for always abusing her he played  with her until her battery ran out kept  her in the toilet for hours always  dropped her around and abused her  thoroughly all this is because she  didn't have the power to say no she  wants to make him feel the same pain  that she and the other electronic  devices face on a daily basis hence she  steals his ring and converts a speaker a  magazine a robot vacuum and a first aid  box into people they join hands t