cks the katana they get into an  intense battle at the end of which both  weapons vanish by now the phone is in  low power mode z-way notices it charging  through a cord and unplugs it turning  the phone into an actual phone and  winning the fight in the last scene  z-way and angel are on the terrace  watching over the city they take off  their rings deciding they are too  dangerous to be practical z-way asks  angel to be his girlfriend and the movie  ends as they hold hands subscribe for  more videos like this turn on  notifications and leave a like to help  the channel out thank you for watching

